  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-13T22:05:21.168Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having additional ways of interacting with the personal mirror system can help people come up with custom placement solutions that will better fit their needs than any amount of application level solution. \nBy exposing the mirror's position, transparency, and other options, it would be possible and easy for users to create their own profiles or configuration patterns in order to quickly set the mirror up for various different use-cases which arise, and they would have the option of putting these configurations either in their own in-game menu, or exposing to an OSC control for alternative ways of setting / enabling them.",
